                  "name": "Intro",
                  "fill": "$ui:brand.ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Micobro no tiene cuentas ni servidores: tus datos están en tu teléfono y, si conectaste Google, en una hoja de tu propio Google Drive. Así borras cada parte.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$ui:font-family",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "fRuc0",
                  "name": "1. En la app",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 10,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "evwMt",
                      "name": "H",
                      "fill": "$ui:brand.ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "1. En la app",
                      "fontFamily": "$ui:font-family",
                      "fontSize": 22,
                      "fontWeight": "800"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zjo1F",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "$ui:brand.ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Abre Mi cuenta → Eliminar mis datos y confirma. La app borra tus clientes, préstamos, pagos, visitas, cuadres, tu perfil y tu PIN, y desconecta tu cuenta de Google. Esto no se puede deshacer.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$ui:font-family",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "500"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "i46EI3",
                  "name": "2. Tu respaldo en Google Drive",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 10,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "UyAub",
                      "name": "H",
                      "fill": "$ui:brand.ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "2. Tu respaldo en Google Drive",
                      "fontFamily": "$ui:font-family",
                      "fontSize": 22,
                      "fontWeight": "800"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "f6Wpuw",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "$ui:brand.ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "La hoja «Micobro / Datos» es tuya y la app no la borra. Para eliminarla, abre drive.google.com, busca la carpeta «Micobro», muévela a la papelera y vacía la papelera.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$ui:font-family",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "500"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
